{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2023-06-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'NUCOR ENTERS INTO CARBON CAPTURE & STORAGE AGREEMENT WITH EXXONMOBIL', 'text': "EXXONMOBIL WILL CAPTURE, TRANSPORT AND STORE CARBON FROM LOUISIANA DRI PLANT CHARLOTTE, N.C. , JUNE 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT WITH EXXONMOBIL TO CAPTURE, TRANSPORT, AND STORE CARBON FROM THE COMPANY'S DIRECT REDUCED IRON (DRI) PLANT IN CONVENT, LOUISIANA."}